This initial native application does not bundle upstream code, model weights,
ONNX Runtime, normalizer-tr, web assets, or fonts. The system voice preview uses
Apple AVFoundation. Upstream license and notice snapshots are preserved under
licenses/upstream for provenance; their presence does not imply those binaries
are included. See docs/DEPENDENCIES.md for scope and integration requirements.
